> d8(x: i8) = 100 / x
> domain d8
domain of d8:
  x: i8, -128..127
  requires x != 0  (in 100/x)
  C assumes not (100 == min and x == -1)  (in 100/x)
  defined at 255 of 256 points
  defined for: -128..-1, 1..127
  undefined e.g. at x=0
  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range d8
range of d8 -> i8:
  -100..100   (39 distinct values)
  values: -100, -50, -33, -25, -20, -16, -14, -12..12, 14, 16, 20, 25, 33, 50, 100
  fits in i8
  undefined at 1 points
  over all 256 points of the domain
> du8(x: u8) = 100 / x
> domain du8
domain of du8:
  x: u8, 0..255
  requires x != 0  (in 100/x)
  defined at 255 of 256 points
  defined for: 1..255
  undefined e.g. at x=0
  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 256 points of the domain
> range du8
range of du8 -> u8:
  0..100   (20 distinct values)
  values: 0..12, 14, 16, 20, 25, 33, 50, 100
  fits in u7
  undefined at 1 points
  over all 256 points of the domain
> dvar(x: i8) = x / (x - 5)
> domain dvar
domain of dvar:
  x: i8, -128..127
  requires x - 5 != 0  (in x/(x - 5))
  C assumes not (x == min and x - 5 == -1)  (in x/(x - 5))
  C assumes x - 5 does not overflow i8  (signed overflow)
  defined at 255 of 256 points
  defined for: -128..4, 6..127
  undefined e.g. at x=5
  C undefined behaviour at 6 points, e.g. x=-128
  over all 256 points of the domain
> d16(x: i16) = 32767 / x
> domain d16
domain of d16:
  x: i16, -32768..32767
  requires x != 0  (in 32767/x)
  C assumes not (32767 == min and x == -1)  (in 32767/x)
  defined at 65535 of 65536 points
  defined for: -32768..-1, 1..32767
  undefined e.g. at x=0
  C undefined behaviour at 1 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> mod0(x: u8) = x % 0
> domain mod0
domain of mod0:
  x: u8, 0..255
  requires 0 != 0  (in x % 0)
  defined at 0 of 256 points
  empty domain: undefined at every point of the parameter types
  undefined e.g. at x=0; x=1; x=2; x=3
  C undefined behaviour at 256 points, e.g. x=0
  over all 256 points of the domain
> mvar(x: i8, y: i8) = x % y
> domain mvar
domain of mvar:
  x: i8, -128..127
  y: i8, -128..127
  requires y != 0  (in x % y)
  C assumes not (x == min and y == -1)  (in x % y)
  defined at 65280 of 65536 points
  undefined e.g. at x=-128, y=0; x=-127, y=0; x=-126, y=0; x=-125, y=0
  C undefined behaviour at 257 points, e.g. x=-128, y=-1
  over all 65536 points of the domain
> dshift(x: u8, n: u8 in 0..3) = x / (n + 1)
> domain dshift
domain of dshift:
  x: u8, 0..255
  n: u8, 0..3
  requires n + 1 != 0  (in x/(n + 1))
  defined at 1024 of 1024 points
  over all 1024 points of the domain
> range dshift
range of dshift -> u8:
  0..255   (256 distinct values)
  fits in u8
  over all 1024 points of the domain
> dchain(x: i8) = 100 / (x / (x - 10))
> domain dchain
domain of dchain:
  x: i8, -128..127
  requires x/(x - 10) != 0  (in 100/(x/(x - 10)))
  C assumes not (100 == min and x/(x - 10) == -1)  (in 100/(x/(x - 10)))
  requires x - 10 != 0  (in x/(x - 10))
  C assumes not (x == min and x - 10 == -1)  (in x/(x - 10))
  C assumes x - 10 does not overflow i8  (signed overflow)
  defined at 128 of 256 points
  defined for: -128..-123, 5..9, 11..127
  undefined e.g. at x=-122; x=-121; x=-120; x=-119
  C undefined behaviour at 134 points, e.g. x=-128
  over all 256 points of the domain
